WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
Where did our coffee come from? But I didn’t take it. I returned it to him. Are you stupid?

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,280
Why don’t you take money when others give it to you for free?

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,080
Next time I'll collect the money first

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,040
Collecting money doesn't mean that you will do things for him.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,900
Now that Yang Feng has started checking the source of goods,

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,570
It means that your mind has changed and starting tomorrow

7
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,890
I won’t deliver Yunfeng milk tea anymore, okay?

8
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:24,910
Boss Jin, please ask Boss Wang inside.

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,280
This place is as delicious as you said

10
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,960
You're not fooling me, are you?

11
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:33,560
Definitely Western Han cuisine

12
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:36,620
Don’t worry, Boss Jin.

13
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:41,020
The last dish will come right away and the chef will serve it.
